	"title"			"SlayTheSpire2.LAN.Multiplayer (unlock everything)"
	"description"		"Play Slay the Spire 2 co-op over your local network instead of through Steam.\n\n[list]\n[*][b]LAN lobby list[/b]: games on your network show up in the Join screen, tagged LAN. You can also join by IP.\n[*][b]Host settings[/b]: choose the port, player limit and your player name.\n[*][b]Reconnects on its own[/b]: if a connection drops mid-run, say when a Steam Deck sleeps, the run picks up where it left off.\n[*][b]Restart Encounter[/b]: the host can restart the current fight, event, shop or rest site from the pause menu.\n[*][b]Everything unlocked[/b]: all characters, cards, relics, potions and acts, every timeline epoch revealed (modded profile only), and any ascension in multiplayer.\n[*][b]Hide map drawings[/b] from any player.\n[/list]\nEveryone in a run needs the same version of the mod.\n\nA fork of kmyuhkyuk's SlayTheSpire2.LAN.Multiplayer, licensed GPL-3.0.\nUpstream: https://github.com/kmyuhkyuk/SlayTheSpire2.LAN.Multiplayer\nSource: https://github.com/gwystylain/SlayTheSpire2.LAN.Multiplayer"
	"changenote"		"${changenote}"
}
